    <body>
      <div type="work" n="147">
        <pb n="192"/>
        <head>147 — i — III. — <quote>Come, hear, and I will tell you</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="preface">
          <ab n="1">On the Holy <persName>Simeon</persName> of the Column.</ab>
        </div>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="2">The sublime and great height of the life of <persName>Simeon</persName> the just and righteous [brings into the mind of<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> believers the words of the Lord which he spake, <quote>A city [that <pb n="193"/> is<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> set upon the top of a hill cannot be hid</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/>. For by ascending to [a sublime height<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> of virtues he showed this<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> clearly and by means of his standing on the column, signifying that he is <quote>a pillar and foundation of the truth</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/> as it is written; drawing both unbelievers and barbarians to godliness<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a8" target="#n8" n="8"/>, and those who were sitting in the darkness<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a9" target="#n9" n="9"/> of error<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a10" target="#n10" n="10"/> to the light of knowledge, like a brightly-shining<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a11" target="#n11" n="11"/> star by its rising : by whose prayers, <persName>Saviour</persName> [of all<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a12" target="#n12" n="12"/>, have pity and mercy upon us.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 192, n. 4</orig></choice> Ps. lxvi, 16.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 192, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>recalls to</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>when</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 2</orig></choice> Matth. v, 14, 15.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 3</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>the summit</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 4</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>thus</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n7" target="#a7" n="7"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 5</orig></choice> 1 Tim. iii, 14, 15 (verbal diff.).</note>
        <note xml:id="n8" target="#a8" n="8"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 6</orig></choice> Corr. representing <foreign xml:lang="grc">εὐσέβεια</foreign>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n9" target="#a9" n="9"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 7</orig></choice> Is. ix, 1, 2 (verbal diff.).</note>
        <note xml:id="n10" target="#a10" n="10"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 8</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>ignorance</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n11" target="#a11" n="11"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 9</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>very bright</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n12" target="#a12" n="12"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 193, n. 10</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>our</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
